# Lint after code changes

After you write or edit code in this repo, run `task lint` before you finish. It runs Ruff check with fixes, Ruff format, and mypy on `phoenix_admin` and `tests`.

- Run it once the code changes are in place, not after every keystroke.
- If it reports an error, fix the code and run `task lint` again.
- Leave the tree lint-clean. Do not finish while `task lint` is failing.
- Skip it when the turn did not change code.
